      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Titan's last message was routine. Then it went silent.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.76,
        "window": 4.4,
        "fill": 0.855
      },
      {
        "scene": "deep",
        "text": "It was 3,363 metres down, near the Titanic. So what happened?",
        "start": 4.7,
        "seconds": 5.73,
        "window": 6.4,
        "fill": 0.895
      },
      {
        "scene": "ship",
        "text": "On the ship, the crew typed a reply. Then another. No answer.",
        "start": 11.1,
        "seconds": 4.08,
        "window": 4.73,
        "fill": 0.863
      },
      {
        "scene": "inch",
        "text": "At the Titanic's depth, the sea presses 5,554.5 pounds on every square inch.",
        "start": 15.83,
        "seconds": 7.21,
        "window": 7.87,
        "fill": 0.916
      },
      {
        "scene": "hull",
        "text": "Holding it back: a carbon fibre tube, 5 inches thick.",
        "start": 23.7,
        "seconds": 3.89,
        "window": 4.53,
        "fill": 0.859
      },
      {
        "scene": "wall",
        "text": "But investigators found that wall was likely already damaged, its layers coming apart.",
        "start": 28.23,
        "seconds": 5.57,
        "window": 6.23,
        "fill": 0.894
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "7 seconds after that message, the hull imploded. All 5 aboard died.",
